00137: {"assertion_index":135,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L138","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":138,"full_assertion":"| CUTECHARM | T 存活、实际接触、r < 30，再 U 可迷恋且接触许可，建立迷恋来源 T |"}
00138: {"assertion_index":136,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L139","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":139,"full_assertion":"| EFFECTSPORE | 实际接触、r < 30，再均匀抽 0 睡/1 毒/2 麻痹；U 已「视为」对应异常时退出。粉末与接触许可、该异常中央资格皆过才提交；不会为免疫重抽。睡眠提交不携来源，毒/麻痹带 T |"}
